WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.020
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.290
No taking advantage of Mr. Deeds!

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:12.210
Mr. Deeds, the anomalous butler summoned by
the ringing of SCP-662, is helpful to a fault,

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:16.699
willing to attempt almost any task that the
bell's holder assigns him.

00:00:16.699 --> 00:00:21.439
That does not, however, mean that Dr. Bright
should take advantage of Mr. Deeds and get

00:00:21.439 --> 00:00:24.470
him to do any of the things on this list.

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:28.779
If Dr. Bright is not allowed to do it, he
is also prohibited from using Mr. Deeds as

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:29.779
a middleman.

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:32.610
Consider that loophole closed.

